[00:00.00] I hope that as you listen to this, you are among your loved ones.
[00:06.00] For I believe that murder, like charity, begins at home.
[00:12.00] After all, some of the most exquisite murders have been domestic,
[00:19.00] performed with tenderness and originality,
[00:23.00] and in simple, homey places like the kitchen table or the bathtub.
[00:30.00] So gentlemen, if you're with your wife, show her how you feel about her.
[00:37.00] Put your arms around her neck and listen to this musical admonition.
[00:44.00] I'll walk alone.
